[{"title":"今日何夕","author":"曾丰","text":"今夕何夕，粲者如许。\n日在于参，心在于户。\n心与火俱，火为心主。\n老人在南，盖得其所。\n今夕何夕，粲者如许。\n其月蕤宾，其日甲午。\n午与火俱，火为午主。\n老臣在南，盖得其侣。\n今夕何夕，绵雨其零。\n于昨之日，维蜩始鸣。\n有祥其声，我国无英，我公挺生。\n今夕何夕，景风其飏。\n于明之朝，维月既望。\n有祯其象，我后无相，我公直上。\n今夕何夕，袢暑其蒸。\n于后之旦，维槿始荣。\n有绰其声，我后中兴。\n我公协成，有功有能。\n我后显旌，不伐不矜。\n我氓盛称，我氓盛称，我公长生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78249,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明日大夫","author":"曾丰","text":"明日大夫，何嘉瑞兮。\n秋金锐兮，凉风至兮。\n公生与□，澄骨气兮。\n寖嶷嶷然，国之器兮。\n明日大夫，何嘉贶兮。\n老火亢兮，白露降兮。\n公生与俱，凝骨相兮。\n寖蔼蔼然，朝之望兮。\n明日大夫，何日侯兮。\n有白其苴，男爵优兮。\n匪朝伊夕，九冕旒兮。\n功崇业广，亘千秋兮。\n明日大夫，何日卿兮。\n有苍其佩，礼官清兮。\n匪朝伊夕，九繁缨兮。\n名遂身退，绵千龄兮。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78250,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南有刺","author":"曾丰","text":"南有刺蓐，又有刺竹。\n有刺竹矣，无刺蓐矣。\n彼竹何族，有刺如簇。\n蹴之者瘃，天委彼酷。\n谁使尔蹴，尔瘃谁讟。\n达者蹈足，恚者仄目。\n斧斤俶俶，自贻伊蝮。\n天道好复，况利于竹。\n南有刺竹，又有刺木。\n有刺木矣，无刺竹矣。\n彼木何族，有刺如簇。\n触之者衄，天委彼酷。\n谁使尔触，尔衄谁讟。\n达者鼓腹，歜者裂肉。\n斧斤畟畟，自贻伊毒。\n天道好复，况利于木。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78251,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题衢州顺溪馆","author":"曾从龙","text":"红照西沉暂解鞍，偶然假馆岂求安。\n新丰独酌谁为侣，坐对窗前竹一竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78252,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题清水寺","author":"曾从龙","text":"壁立峥嵘万仞峰，骑鲸俄蜕葛陂筇。\n空流诗句传千古，今在蓬莱第几重。\n岩上胜游成幻梦，壁间遗迹暗尘容。\n山僧好把纱笼护，莫学阇黎饭后钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78253,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月下笛 次韵","author":"曾允元","text":"又老杨花，浮萍点点，一溪春色。\n闲寻旧迹。\n认溪头、浣纱碛。\n柔条折尽成轻别，向空外、瑶簪一掷。\n算无情更苦，莺巢暗叶，啼破幽寂。\n凝立。\n阑干侧。\n记露饮东园，联镳西陌。\n容销鬓减，相逢应自难识。\n东风吹得愁似海，谩点染，空阶自碧。\n独归晚，解说心中事，月下短笛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78254,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟 春梦","author":"曾允元","text":"日高深院无人，杨花扑帐春云暖。\n回文未就，停针不语，绣床倚遍。\n翠被笼香，绿鬟坠腻，伤春成怨。\n尽云山烟水，柔情一缕，又暗逐、金鞍远。\n鸾佩相逢甚处，似当年、刘郎仙苑。\n凭肩后约，画眉新巧，从来未惯。\n枕落钗声，帘开燕语，风流云散。\n甚依稀难记，人间天上，有缘重见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78255,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐天乐 次韵赵芳谷曲，有香玉之怨","author":"曾允元","text":"碧梧枝上占秋信，微闻雨声还惬。\n虹影分晴，云光透晚，残日依依团箑。\n阑干一霎。\n又长笛归舟，乱鸦荒堞。\n两鬓西风，有人心事到红叶。\n娇莲相对欲语，奈莲茎有刺，愁不成折。\n天上欢期，人间巧意，今夜明河如雪。\n新宽带结。\n想宝篆频温，翠奁低揭。\n雾湿云鬟，浅妆深拜月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78256,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊曹觐","author":"曾公亮","text":"款军樵门日再晡，空弮犹自把戈鈇。\n身垂虎口方安坐，命若鸿毛竟败呼。\n柱下杲卿曾断骨，裤中杵臼得遗孤。\n可怜三尺英雄气，不怕山西士大夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78257,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽老苏先生","author":"曾公亮","text":"立言高往古，抱道郁当时。\n铅椠方终业，风灯忽遘悲。\n名垂文苑传，行纪太丘碑。\n后嗣皆鸾鷟，吾知庆有诒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78258,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事中知越州","author":"曾公亮","text":"山阴地胜冠江吴，今得贤侯自禁途。\n侍从暂虚青琐闼，藩宣新剖玉麟符。\n移时前席辞旒扆，不日重城歌裤襦。\n想到蓬莱游未遍，已应归步在云衢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78259,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿甘露寺僧舍","author":"曾公亮","text":"枕中云气千峰近，床底松声万壑哀。\n要看银山拍天浪，开窗放入大江来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78260,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"曾公亮","text":"饭思白石红桃米，菜忆黄龙紫芥心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78261,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"摸鱼儿 寿吴权州","author":"曾开国","text":"望层霄、五云开处。\n屏星光射螺浦。\n复来七日冬将至，恰则岳神生甫。\n梅半吐。\n试索笑巡檐，稍稍香风度。\n花娇欲语。\n问昔日治平，吴公无传，今请为公歌襦裤。\n□□□，玉粒家家丰贮。\n因人岂关天数。\n金城千里谁能护，前召又逢后杜。\n□□□。\n见说道、长安新筑沙堤路。\n班催鹭序。\n春色醉蟠桃，胸中色线，待把衮衣补。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78262,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读留题张许双庙诗","author":"曾伋","text":"篇卷留题尽昔贤，读之英气凛然寒。\n时人不晓尊崇意，都与丛祠一例看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78263,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题张许双庙","author":"曾伋","text":"国凭节义壮洪基，激厉颓风属圣时。\n曾屈帝尊亲降辇，可因祈福幸公祠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78264,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月","author":"曾布","text":"二月春华已半归，江天况值雨垂垂。\n山梅倏忽花经眼，园杏须臾子满枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78265,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 排遍第四","author":"曾布","text":"一夕还家醉，开户起相迎。\n为郎引裾相庇，低首略潜形。\n情深无隐。\n欲郎乘间起佳兵。\n授青萍。\n茫然抚叹，不忍欺心。\n尔能负心于彼，于我必无情。\n熟视花钿不足，刚肠终不能平。\n假手迎天意，一挥霜刃。\n窗间粉颈断瑶琼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78266,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 带花遍","author":"曾布","text":"向红尘里，有喧呼攘臂，转声辟众，莫遣人冤滥、杀张室，忍偷生。\n僚吏惊呼呵叱，狂辞不变如初，投身属吏，慷慨吐丹诚。\n仿佛缧绁，自疑梦中，闻者皆惊叹，为不平。\n割爱无心，泣对虞姬，手戮倾城宠，翻然起死，不教仇怨负冤声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78267,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 撷花十八","author":"曾布","text":"义城元靖贤相国，喜慕英雄士，赐金缯。\n闻斯事，频叹赏，封章归印。\n请赎冯燕罪，日边紫泥封诏，阖境赦深刑。\n万古三河风义在，青简上、众知名。\n河东注，任流水滔滔，水涸名难泯。\n至今乐府歌咏。\n流入管弦声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78268,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 排遍第一","author":"曾布","text":"魏豪有冯燕，年少客幽并。\n击球斗鸡为戏，游侠久知名。\n因避仇、来东郡。\n元戎留属中军。\n直气凌貔虎，须臾叱咤风云。\n凛凛坐中生。\n偶乘佳兴。\n轻裘锦带，东风跃马，往来寻访幽胜。\n游冶出东城。\n堤上莺花撩乱，香车宝马纵横。\n草软平沙稳。\n高楼两岸春风，语笑隔帘声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78269,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 排遍第五","author":"曾布","text":"凤凰钗、宝玉凋零。\n惨然怅，娇魂怨，饮泣吞声。\n还被凌波呼唤，相将金谷同游，想见逢迎处，揶揄羞面，妆脸泪盈盈。\n醉眠人、醒来晨起，血凝螓首，但惊喧，白邻里、骇我卒难明。\n思败幽囚推究，覆盆无计哀鸣。\n丹笔终诬服，圜门驱拥，衔冤垂首欲临刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78270,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 排遍第三","author":"曾布","text":"说良人滑将张婴。\n从来嗜酒，还家镇长酩酊狂酲。\n屋上鸣鸠空斗，梁间客燕相惊。\n谁与花为主，兰房从此，朝云夕雨两牵萦。\n似游丝飘荡，随风无定。\n奈何岁华荏苒，欢计苦难凭。\n唯见新恩缱绻，连枝并翼，香闺日日为郎，谁知松萝托蔓，一比一毫轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78271,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 排遍第二","author":"曾布","text":"袖笼鞭敲镫。\n无语独闲行。\n绿杨下、人初静。\n烟澹夕阳明。\n窈窕佳人，独立瑶阶，掷果潘郎，瞥见红颜横波盼，不胜娇软倚银屏。\n曳红裳，频推朱户，半开还掩，似欲倚、咿哑声里，细说深情。\n因遣林间青鸟，为言彼此心期，的的深相许，窃香解佩，绸缪相顾不胜情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78272,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江南好/忆江南","author":"曾布","text":"江南客，家有宁馨儿。\n三世文章称大手，一门兄弟独良眉。\n藉甚众多推。\n千里足，来自渥洼池。\n莫倚善题鹦鹉赋，青山须待健时归。\n不似傲当时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78273,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤壁","author":"曾用孙","text":"白浪高于屋，风回熨帖平。\n周郎呼不醒，久立听江声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78274,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中书程先生委校勘春秋分纪大参李雁湖文集因元夕戏成一绝","author":"曾由基","text":"雪柳梢头闹玉梅，万家灯火月楼台。\n校雠幸不开天上，省得扶藜太乙来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78275,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖夜景","author":"曾由基","text":"处处芙蕖处处堂，闲行何地不清香。\n归舟又趁晚凉急，十里湖光蘸夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78276,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖夜景","author":"曾由基","text":"閒窗放入四山青，古篆无烟气自清。\n风不鸣条花著露，一湖春月万蛙声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78277,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余秋责余不归责之诚是也余非敢忘乡井而答以诗","author":"曾由基","text":"兔狡应多穴，狐妖解首丘。\n一巢鸠样拙，何计老菟裘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78278,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶作 其三","author":"曾由基","text":"遣愁时复赋篇章，此是书生习未忘。\n小吏岂堪人看觑，酒边生怕带诗狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78279,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶作 其一","author":"曾由基","text":"才退愁无友，时艰悔有家。\n乡心惭杜宇，世事付杨花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78280,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚思","author":"曾由基","text":"风号谷应树声喧，阴雨潇潇南北村。\n倦翼投林舟宿港，满怀秋思立黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78281,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"聚景园追凉","author":"曾由基","text":"五云缥缈护檐牙，不是寻常富贵家。\n树树风蝉凉意足，衣巾时复堕槐花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78282,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲蜡梅","author":"曾由基","text":"孤芳不被雪霜欺，占得南枝最崛奇。\n气骨不凡风韵少，吕医初见退之诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78283,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题杨敬之赠项斯诗后","author":"曾由基","text":"今古销沉几项斯，由来作者不祈知。\n看渠一片怜才意，合把黄金铸敬之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78284,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈陟屺寺","author":"曾由基","text":"幽泉落窦碎琼声，疑是朝天环佩鸣。\n绕寺杉松皆雨露，不应秋叶似恩轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78285,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题昌黎传后","author":"曾由基","text":"唐治百年生退之，行藏端的系兴衰。\n三书何用干时宰，天使斯人欲有知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78286,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题御爱牡丹","author":"曾由基","text":"天香不数魏姚家，玉砌雕栏护绛纱。\n闻说弓旌遍岩穴，怜才应是胜怜花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78287,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与中朝故人","author":"曾由基","text":"自怜骨相太邅迍，为米折腰依旧贫。\n古史多看多警省，新诗愈改愈精神。\n与游造物真知己，怕说天朝多故人。\n兰菊有时忙不得，世间桃李几番新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78288,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕同友街游","author":"曾由基","text":"月韵梅梢漏未央，缓寻梦境小相羊。\n万家灯火天无夜，十里绮罗风自香。\n胜友何如罗粉黛，清谈端可厌笙簧。\n吴侬休作筑城舞，胡越年来共一疆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78289,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕酒倦","author":"曾由基","text":"解酲贡浪语，欲困且长谣。\n古篆生春霭，新汤响夜潮。\n喜寻搜句伴，怕有看灯招。\n背却笙歌闹，鸣琴慰寂寥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78290,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古寺","author":"曾由基","text":"残经闲竹几，瀹茗供花瓷。\n法窟寂无语，禅容晚带饥。\n虫萦道子画，蛩响外孙碑。\n风定闻疏磬，玄关却自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78291,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宦辙","author":"曾由基","text":"宦辙驰驱尘满襟，解鞍呼酒小登临。\n天垂碧处秋江净，山弄紫时西日沉。\n韩记合还渠老手，王诗似不要新吟。\n撑天拄地吾儒事，过耳飞禽空好音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78292,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵岁寒昆季三人拉李学谕余同游南湖次岁寒韵","author":"曾由基","text":"紫麒麟楦岂身荣，腹有诗书气便清。\n野酌雅宜招胜士，贵游大半是宗英。\n主翁旧有登堂约，古树今知夹道迎。\n剩欲索梅同一笑，却随画角弄初更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78293,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送广西郑经干并简经略","author":"曾由基","text":"五岭宜人地，君今捧檄行。\n但拚穷彻骨，不到黯无声。\n婉画从违里，编氓休戚情。\n祖筵谁执爵，三祝石先生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78294,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送玉堂守永嘉","author":"曾由基","text":"衮衮诸公塞要津，独当椽笔演丝纶。\n久陪清禁聊均佚，谁道明河不可亲。\n畿郡喜迎贤太守，帝旁却欠直词臣。\n逸才毕竟九天忆，应谓禁中须此人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78295,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶作 其二","author":"曾由基","text":"故山荏苒失归期，颜尚如丹鬓已丝。\n忆昔师门传拙赋，迄今客路懒工诗。\n不伤迟暮无豪举，却喜聪明减旧时。\n便把蜗庐题退隐，何时买得草堂基。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78296,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游益公平园怀宜春周宰颂诗","author":"曾由基","text":"丞相非嗔客，名流每举樽。\n鱼烹惟沼在，鹤化有轩存。\n惜欠尧夫子，幸生夷简孙。\n平泉落谁手，文献说平园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78297,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答诗友徵近诗","author":"曾由基","text":"寄傲西峰未肯东，论文旧约几时同。\n不知杰句真何用，便有虚名岂疗穷。\n珍重远书徵近作，疏芜故我欠新功。\n每惭时辈多豪逸，点笔成章杯酒中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78298,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与陈刚父论诗","author":"曾由基","text":"少陵久矣跨鲸游，近说西江沸不休。\n双井发源注南海，百川分港失东流。\n君怀正印高悬眼，我抉玄关笑点头。\n半世工夫缘底事，旁人却作等闲求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78299,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用坡仙郁孤台韵送郑绣使还朝","author":"曾由基","text":"人人羡登仙，去作上界游。\n谁知世蒙恩，公其晦叔流。\n众芳正回春，一叶偶似秋。\n灵修岂数化，宿莽休槛洲。\n却怜贪荣人，前后几蜃楼。\n策今陈洛阳，疏肯谀沧州。\n阊阖浮云开，台阁清风留。\n所期共推庆历车，可复偏重元祐舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78300,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖冰合忽见小舟","author":"曾由基","text":"四望黯同云，平湖堕银汉。\n一叶柳边来，应是寒澌泮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78301,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"胡讲书赴张国录讲席之招良月也","author":"曾由基","text":"初日融霜泮水清，鹄袍翔集宿中庭。\n先生有道如阳月，太白占祥聚德星。\n安定重来阐湖学，横渠端坐讲西铭。\n自怜一唯无传久，避席何时觌典刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78302,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺林正字","author":"曾由基","text":"道山群玉聚，前辈说乾淳。\n近代岂乏士，清时赖有君。\n谁传艾轩派，喜得嫡孙亲。\n所欠非荣进，名流万古芬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78303,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游宜春北岩","author":"曾由基","text":"宦躯真沐漆，放怀北岩去。\n行行如蔍境，渐入幽绝处。\n湿翠欲沾衣，晴云乱生屦。\n滩声时抑扬，岚气互吞吐。\n松寒韵笙竽，碣石状钟虡。\n朱实袅碧藤，白羽明翠坞。\n提壶忌人醒，市醑邀我沽。\n野果枝头寻，水乐空中度。\n饮少辄颓玉，山灵劳拱护。\n起来一凭栏，件件是佳句。\n此景几百年，却待予全付。\n吟成石点头，喜极石应语。\n何处一鸣鹤，而作赏音和。\n仰峰人所仰，隔江不受呼。\n正如山中人，九诏不一顾。\n传闻唐卫公，挟册曾此寓。\n皋夔读何书，瑰誉响千古。\n一生拗介甫，政坐读书误。\n公乎傥可作，同草遂初赋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78304,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画梅水仙山矾三友图","author":"曾由基","text":"野梅清靖节，水仙韵坡公。\n山谷秀而野，厥有山矾风。\n陶苏黄三君，时异风味同。\n后人思典刑，写入画图中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78305,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题潘庭坚乐府后奉简陈佥书","author":"曾由基","text":"性灵底物堪陶冶，郢曲弥高和弥寡。\n锦囊勿使六丁偷，会有昌黎赏东野。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78306,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠贵官家小姬","author":"曾由基","text":"小蛮初按曲，趁拍入凉州。\n宫羽偶失次，回眸顾部头。\n部头色微嗔，面赭含娇羞。\n低鬟语同伴，周郎曾顾不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78307,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题仙都山二首 其二","author":"曾会","text":"瀛洲风月十年馀，东出云堂典郡符。\n更到烟霞最深处，分明景物是仙都。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78308,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题砚水","author":"曾会","text":"落笔重重见险津，不堪凭仗洗埃尘。\n无波浪处生波浪，愁杀孤帆过海人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78309,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上齐山","author":"曾会","text":"秋日悬光八使来，笙歌十里郡筵开。\n六朝草色铺堤路，九日花香泛酒杯。\n红袖歌长凝粉黛，紫微诗久蔽尘埃。\n贤人此会知无尽，不畏年华似箭催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78310,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]